Package: scMarkerViz
Title: Reproducible Marker Effect Plots for Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Daoqiu", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "wangdaoqiu086@gmail.com")
Description: Creates reproducible cluster-wise marker effect plots from
    differential expression tables. The package provides explicit column
    mapping, validated significance classification, deterministic point
    placement, stable marker selection, and vertical or horizontal layouts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/DaoqiuWang/scMarkerViz
BugReports: https://github.com/DaoqiuWang/scMarkerViz/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
